      "created_at": "2014-08-18T08:24:37.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi,</p>\n<p>Thanks to the earlier Omnitron posts we’re pretty clear on all the ruling issues we encountered with him.<br>\nI just want to check the rules for his dual lazer power (not sure the exact name).<br>\nIt says he may attack two different targets.<br>\nSo the questions are:<br>\nAre these two actions or one<br>\nDoes the player roll for each attack or use one dice roll for both<br>\nIf an aim is spent is this applicable to both attacks or just one?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:13.324Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
