      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Hi, \r\n\r\nThanks to the earlier Omnitron posts we're pretty clear on all the ruling issues we encountered with him. \r\nI just want to check the rules for his dual lazer power (not sure the exact name). \r\nIt says he may attack two different targets. \r\nSo the questions are:\r\nAre these two actions or one\r\nDoes the player roll for each attack or use one dice roll for both \r\nIf an aim is spent is this applicable to both attacks or just one?",
