      "created_at": "2014-08-18T08:47:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It's one roll, the dice apply to all targets*, however any tokens spent only apply to one target designated before the dice are rolled.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>*The same applies to any multi-target attack</p>",
